  "在这里讨论的典型真核细胞周期中，DNA 在 S 期复制，有丝分裂负责分配已复制的遗传物质。一条染色体复制后形成两条姐妹染色单体；复制本身不意味着染色体数立即加倍。": "In the typical eukaryotic cell cycle discussed here, DNA is replicated during S phase, and mitosis is responsible for distributing the replicated genetic material. One chromosome replicates to form two sister chromatids; replication itself does not mean that the number of chromosomes immediately doubles.",
