  "前导链与每个冈崎片段的延伸都遵守 5′→3′。这里仅完成一个小片段，不是整条染色体。": "The leading strand and each Okazaki fragment extend in the 5′→3′ direction. This exercise completes only a short segment, not a whole chromosome.",
  "互补配对正确。现在还只是候选核苷酸就位，尚未与新链形成共价连接。": "Complementary pairs are correct. Only the candidate nucleotide is now in place and has not yet formed a covalent link to the new strand.",
  "PPᵢ 是焦磷酸，含两个磷原子；它与前面 ATP 水解中的 Pᵢ 不同。省略电荷、质子与 Mg²⁺ 配位。": "PPᵢ is pyrophosphate and contains two phosphorus atoms. It differs from the Pᵢ shown in ATP hydrolysis. Charges, protons, and Mg²⁺ coordination are omitted.",
  "DNA 聚合酶 · 简化总反应": "DNA polymerase · Simplified overall reaction",
