  "TP：糖–Pα–Pβ–Pγ": "TP: Sugar–Pα–Pβ–Pγ",
  "选择一个完整的脱氧核苷三磷酸（dNTP），不是只选择游离碱基。": "Select a complete deoxynucleoside triphosphate (dNTP), not just the free base.",
  "下一步：3′ 端与 α 磷酸形成骨架连接，β、γ 磷酸作为 PPᵢ 离开。": "Next step: The 3′ end forms a backbone connection with the α phosphate, and the β and γ phosphates leave as PPᵢ.",
