  "配对。请再选一次。这里的选择反馈不代表聚合酶校对已经发生。": "pair. Please select again. Selection feedback here does not mean that polymerase proofreading has occurred.",
  "：形成一条新的磷酸二酯键并释放 PPᵢ。新链的 3′-OH 移到了刚加入的核苷酸上。": ": Forms a new phosphodiester bond and releases PPᵢ. The 3′-OH of the new strand is moved to the newly added nucleotide.",
  "新链又延长了一个核苷酸，方向仍是 5′→3′。": "The new strand is extended by one nucleotide, still in the direction 5′→3′.",
  "替换 RNA 引物": "Replace RNA primers",
  "RNA 引物被移除，缺口由 DNA 补上。所用酶因生物类群而异；下图只表示处理结果。": "The RNA primer is removed and the gap is filled in with DNA. The enzymes used vary by organism group; the figures below only represent the results of the treatment.",
  "连接骨架断口": "Seal backbone nicks",
  "追踪亲代链": "Tracing the parent chain",
  "许多复制型 DNA 聚合酶在延伸时可移除新链 3′ 端的错配核苷酸，再继续合成；并不是等整条 DNA 复制完才统一校对。本课“选错后重选”只用于练习配对，不是校对机制动画。": "Many replicative DNA polymerases can remove mismatched nucleotides at the 3' end of the new strand during extension before continuing synthesis; they do not wait for the entire DNA to be copied before uniformly proofreading it. This lesson \"Reselect after making a wrong choice\" is only for practice matching, not for proofreading mechanism animation.",
  "DNA 连接酶封闭相邻 DNA 之间的骨架断口。补入核苷酸与封闭断口是不同的工作。": "DNA ligase seals backbone breaks between adjacent DNA. Filling in nucleotides and sealing the break are different tasks.",
  "粉色 RNA 已替换为 DNA；中间断口被放大标记。": "Pink RNA has been replaced by DNA; the intermediate break is marked with amplification.",
  "每个子代 DNA 都含一条亲代链和一条新合成链：这就是半保留复制。下图为结果概览，并非本练习已经复制完整条染色体。": "Each daughter DNA contains one parental strand and one newly synthesized strand: this is semiconservative replication. The picture below is an overview of the results. It does not mean that a complete chromosome has been copied in this exercise.",
  "断口封闭后，DNA 骨架连续。": "After the break is closed, the DNA backbone is continuous.",
