  "数据：": "data:",
  "来源：Geobacillus stearothermophilus 的 DnaB，生物学组装体 1。配体为 GDP–AlF₄；用于观察环状结构、DNA 和结合位点，不代表 ATP 水解的四个连续状态。": "Source: DnaB of Geobacillus stearothermophilus, biological assembly 1. The ligand is GDP–AlF₄; ​​used to visualize the ring structure, DNA, and binding sites and does not represent the four consecutive states of ATP hydrolysis.",
  "Itsathitphaisarn 等，Cell (2012)": "Itsathitphaisarn et al., Cell (2012)",
  "Mol* / Sehnal 等 (2021)": "Mol*/Sehnal et al. (2021)",
  "。显示用飘带与球棍表达实验坐标，未显示所有溶剂分子。查看器：": ". Experimental coordinates are expressed using streamers and balls and sticks, and all solvent molecules are not shown. Viewer:",
  "以细菌 DnaB 为例 · 六亚基环状解旋酶": "Take bacterial DnaB as an example · Six-subunit cyclic helicase",
  "DnaB 解旋与 ATP 循环示意": "DnaB unwinding and ATP cycle diagram",
  "虚线：碱基间氢键示意": "Dotted line: schematic representation of hydrogen bonds between bases",
  "青色：被环包围的链": "Cyan: chain surrounded by rings",
  "橙色：排除链": "Orange: exclude chain",
  "ATP 水解 · 简化总反应": "ATP hydrolysis · Simplified overall reaction",
  "解开的是双链间的配对；DNA 单链的糖–磷酸骨架保持完整。": "What is unraveled is the pairing between the double strands; the sugar-phosphate backbone of the single strand of DNA remains intact.",
  "进一步理解：能量、化学键与模型边界": "Further understanding: energy, chemical bonds, and model boundaries",
  "能量从哪里来？": "Where does the energy come from?",
  "播放过程": "Playback process",
  "反应式省略了什么？": "What does the equation omit?",
  "ATP 水解的整体自由能变化可与蛋白质构象变化和定向运动耦联。不能把“断开 ATP 的一个键”本身说成释放能量；断键需要能量，整个反应的能量收支还包括新键形成及产物与水的相互作用。": "The overall free energy change of ATP hydrolysis can be coupled to protein conformational changes and directional motion. \"Breaking a bond in ATP\" cannot in itself be said to release energy; bond breaking requires energy, and the energy budget of the entire reaction also includes the formation of new bonds and the interaction of the product with water.",
  "DNA 为什么能分开？": "Why can DNA be separated?",
  "Pᵢ 表示无机磷酸。此式省略电荷、质子化状态和 Mg²⁺ 配位；它是生化简写，不是指定 pH 下的完整离子方程式。ATP 没有变成 DNA 的组成部分。": "Pᵢ denotes inorganic phosphate. This biochemical shorthand omits charges, protonation states, and Mg²⁺ coordination; it is not a complete ionic equation at a specified pH. The ATP shown here does not become part of DNA.",
  "模型边界。": "model boundaries.",
  "解旋涉及碱基间氢键及碱基堆积相互作用的改变，不是把共价骨架剪断。模型的虚线只代表配对关系，没有按 A–T 两个、G–C 三个氢键逐一绘制。": "Unwinding involves changes in hydrogen bonds between bases and base stacking interactions, rather than shearing the covalent backbone. The dotted lines of the model only represent the pairing relationship, and the two A–T and three G–C hydrogen bonds are not drawn one by one.",
  "机制依据：": "Mechanism based on:",
  "本视图把结合、水解、构象变化和产物释放拆成四个学习阶段；真实六个亚基会协同工作，不能据此推断严格的同步时序或 ATP/碱基对比例。亚基形状、运动幅度和空间尺寸为示意，未显示原子结构、加载蛋白或完整复制复合体。真核复制解旋酶的组成与运动方向不同。": "This view breaks down binding, hydrolysis, conformational change, and product release into four learning stages; the real six subunits will work together, and strict synchronization timing or ATP/base pair ratios cannot be inferred from this. Subunit shapes, motion amplitudes, and spatial dimensions are schematic, and atomic structures, loading proteins, or complete replication complexes are not shown. Eukaryotic replicative helicases differ in composition and direction of movement.",
  "DnaB 与排除链的相互作用": "Interaction of DnaB with the excluded strand",
  "DnaB ATP 结合、水解与构象转变研究": "Study on ATP binding, hydrolysis and conformational transition of DnaB",
  "ATP 结合": "ATP binding",
  "高亮 ATP：此时强调结合，尚未在图中显示水解产物。": "Highlight ATP: At this point the binding is emphasized and the hydrolysis products are not yet shown in the diagram.",
  "ATP 与酶的核苷酸结合位点结合。DnaB 环包围一条单链；另一条链走环的外侧。": "ATP binds to the nucleotide binding site of the enzyme. The DnaB ring surrounds one single strand; the other strand runs outside the ring.",
  "水参与水解": "Water participates in hydrolysis",
  "构象改变，推进解旋": "Conformational changes promote unwinding",
  "亚基与 DNA 的接触关系改变，运动与核苷酸循环耦联。DnaB 沿包围链的 5′→3′ 方向推进，使另一条链被排开。": "The contact relationship between subunits and DNA changes, and the movement is coupled to the nucleotide cycle. DnaB advances in the 5′→3′ direction of the surrounding strand, causing the other strand to be pushed out of the way.",
  "结合的 ATP 经水解形成 ADP 与无机磷酸（Pᵢ）。化学反应与蛋白质的状态变化相联系。": "The bound ATP is hydrolyzed to form ADP and inorganic phosphate (Pᵢ). Chemical reactions are associated with changes in the state of proteins.",
  "高亮 H₂O、ADP 与 Pᵢ：水参与反应，末端磷酸成为无机磷酸。": "Highlight H₂O, ADP and Pᵢ: water participates in the reaction and the terminal phosphate becomes inorganic phosphate.",
  "产物离开酶：继续解旋需要后续核苷酸循环。": "The product leaves the enzyme: subsequent nucleotide cycles are required for continued unwinding.",
  "反应与机械运动耦联；此图的移动距离不对应一个 ATP 或一个碱基对。": "The reaction is coupled to mechanical motion; the distance traveled in this diagram does not correspond to one ATP or one base pair.",
  "ADP 与 Pᵢ 释放，位点可参与后续循环。多亚基协同使解旋继续，已分开的两条 DNA 骨架仍完整。": "ADP and Pᵢ are released, and the site can participate in subsequent cycles. Multiple subunits cooperate to continue unwinding, and the two separated DNA backbones remain intact.",
  "产物释放，继续循环": "Product is released and the cycle continues",
