  "走进一个细胞，观察物质怎样穿过膜、DNA 怎样复制与分配，以及能量怎样参与生命活动。亲手操作模型，把看到的变化连成自己的理解。": "Walk into a cell and observe how matter passes through membranes, how DNA is replicated and distributed, and how energy participates in life activities. Manipulate the model with your own hands and connect the changes you see into your own understanding.",
