  "可旋转 DNA 复制叉模型，拖动或使用方向键旋转；加减键缩放。模型详细说明见右侧学习卡片。": "Rotate the DNA replication fork model by dragging or using the arrow keys to rotate; plus and minus keys to zoom. For detailed description of the model, see the learning card on the right.",
