  "单因素教学模型：仅改变所选酶的作用，其余过程按示意条件继续。真实细胞中复制活动相互耦联；此处不模拟长期停滞、损伤响应或真实反应速率。": "Single-factor teaching model: only change the action of the selected enzyme, and the rest of the process continues according to the schematic conditions. Replicative activities are coupled in real cells; no long-term arrests, damage responses, or real reaction rates are simulated here.",
  "放大解旋酶": "amplified helicase",
  "拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 方向键也可操作": "Drag to rotate · Wheel to zoom · Arrow keys can also be operated",
  "单个复制叉 · 立体教学示意": "Single replication fork · Three-dimensional teaching diagram",
  "模型说明：为突出方向关系，模型将复制后的链展开显示；形状、距离、速度与片段长度不按真实比例。阶段被拆开以便学习，细胞中多种活动会重叠进行。未展示完整复制复合体、滞后链环和所有辅助蛋白。": "Model description: In order to highlight the directional relationship, the model expands and displays the copied chain; the shape, distance, speed and fragment length are not in real proportions. Stages are broken up to allow for learning, with multiple activities in the cell overlapping. The complete replication complex, lagging links, and all accessory proteins are not shown.",
