  "延伸。": "extend.",
  "DNA 聚合酶把核苷酸加到新链的 3′ 端。两条模板反向平行，因此在同一复制叉，一条新链连续合成，另一条分段合成。": "DNA polymerase adds nucleotides to the 3′ end of the new strand. The two templates are antiparallel, so at the same replication fork, one new strand is synthesized continuously and the other is synthesized segmentally.",
