  "来源：": "Sources: ",
  "本页帮助定位结构；选择内膜与嵴可进入 ATP 合成课程，继续观察电子传递与质子梯度。模型不计算 ATP 产量。": "This page helps locate the structure; select the inner membrane and cristae to enter the ATP synthesis lesson and continue observing electron transport and proton gradients. The model does not calculate ATP production.",
  "细胞器深度探索 · 02": "In-depth exploration of cell organelles · 02",
  "ATP 合成：质子梯度怎样变成 ATP？": "ATP synthesis: How does a proton gradient drive it?",
