  "核对依据": "Check basis",
  "示意画面与文字为教学目的编写；具体分镜与复合体标注已按上列来源逐条核对，化学计量与能量换算不在本轮范围。": "The schematic images and text are written for teaching purposes; the specific storyboards and complex annotations have been checked one by one according to the sources listed above. Chemical measurement and energy conversion are not within the scope of this round.",
  "返回": "return",
  "线粒体结构探索": "Exploration of mitochondrial structure",
  "继续查看结构；把结构、质子流动与 ATP 合成联系起来。": "Continue looking at the structure; connect the structure, proton flow, and ATP synthesis.",
  "细胞膜：边界由什么组成？": "Cell Membrane: What does the boundary consist of?",
  "选择一种结构，观察它在哪里，再解释它怎样参与构成细胞边界。": "Choose a structure, observe where it is, and explain how it participates in forming the cell boundary.",
  "典型动物细胞质膜 · 局部教学示意": "Typical animal cell plasma membrane·Partial teaching illustration",
  "要点": "Main points",
  "图例：颜色之外还看形状": "Legend: Look beyond color to shape",
