  "先做一个预测": "Make a prediction first",
  "提交预测": "Submit prediction",
  "细胞外侧": "extracellular",
  "胞质溶胶侧": "cytosol side",
  "亲水头部": "Hydrophilic head",
  "分布在双层的两个表面，分别朝向细胞外液和胞质溶胶。": "Distributed on both surfaces of the bilayer, facing the extracellular fluid and cytosol respectively.",
  "与水环境接触，是磷脂分子的一部分。": "It comes into contact with the water environment and is part of the phospholipid molecule.",
  "头部不只朝向细胞外：双层内侧的头部也接触水环境。": "The head doesn't just face the outside of the cell: the head on the inside of the double layer is also in contact with the aqueous environment.",
  "胆固醇": "cholesterol",
  "嵌在磷脂分子之间，极性端靠近头部区域。": "Embedded between phospholipid molecules, the polar end is close to the head region.",
  "是动物细胞膜的组成成分，参与调节膜的物理性质。": "It is a component of animal cell membranes and participates in regulating the physical properties of the membrane.",
  "它不是跨膜蛋白；本轮只识别位置，不模拟温度效应。": "It is not a transmembrane protein; epicycle only recognizes position and does not model temperature effects.",
  "糖蛋白": "glycoprotein",
  "糖链连接在蛋白上，糖链部分朝向细胞外。": "The sugar chains are attached to the protein, with the sugar chain part facing outside the cell.",
  "疏水尾部": "hydrophobic tail",
  "位于双层内部，上下两层的尾部相向。": "Located inside the double-layer, the tail ends of the upper and lower layers face each other.",
  "共同构成膜的疏水内部。": "Together they form the hydrophobic interior of the membrane.",
  "头部和尾部属于同一个磷脂分子；上下两层的磷脂并未彼此连成一个分子。": "The head and tail belong to the same phospholipid molecule; the phospholipids in the upper and lower layers are not connected to each other to form one molecule.",
  "跨膜蛋白": "transmembrane protein",
  "穿过磷脂双层，在膜两侧都有暴露的部分。": "Passing through the phospholipid bilayer, there are exposed portions on both sides of the membrane.",
  "不同跨膜蛋白可参与运输、接收信号等不同功能。": "Different transmembrane proteins can participate in different functions such as transport and signal reception.",
  "不是每个跨膜蛋白都是通道；本图不演示运输。": "Not every transmembrane protein is a channel; this diagram does not demonstrate transport.",
  "外周蛋白": "Peripheral protein",
  "附着于膜的一侧表面；本图放在胞质溶胶侧。": "Attached to one surface of the membrane; this image is placed on the cytosol side.",
  "不同外周蛋白可参与连接、酶促反应或信号过程。": "Different peripheral proteins can participate in ligation, enzymatic reactions, or signaling processes.",
  "外周蛋白不穿过整层膜，名称中的“外周”也不等于只在细胞外侧。": "Peripheral proteins do not pass through the entire membrane, and the \"peripheral\" in the name does not mean that they are only on the outside of the cell.",
  "可参与细胞识别与相互作用。": "Can participate in cell recognition and interaction.",
  "本图的糖蛋白也跨膜；“带糖链”和“是否跨膜”是不同分类角度。": "The glycoprotein in this picture also spans the membrane; \"carrying sugar chains\" and \"whether it spans the membrane\" are different classification angles.",
  "糖脂": "Glycolipids",
  "糖链连接在脂质上，糖链部分朝向细胞外。": "Sugar chains are attached to lipids, with the sugar chain part facing outside the cell.",
  "参与形成细胞表面的识别特征。": "Participates in the formation of identifying features on the cell surface.",
  "与糖蛋白的区别是糖链连接的对象不同，不是糖链朝向不同。": "The difference from glycoprotein is that the sugar chains are connected to different objects, not the orientation of the sugar chains.",
  "哪项描述符合这张动物细胞质膜示意图？": "Which description fits this diagram of the plasma membrane of an animal cell?",
  "两侧亲水头部接触水环境，疏水尾部朝向双层内部。": "The hydrophilic heads on both sides are in contact with the water environment, and the hydrophobic tails face the inside of the double layer.",
  "正确。磷脂的两部分性质不同，图中头部朝向两侧水环境，尾部位于双层内部。": "correct. The two parts of the phospholipid have different properties. In the picture, the head faces the water environment on both sides, and the tail is located inside the double layer.",
  "只有朝向细胞外的那一层含有亲水头部。": "Only the layer facing the outside of the cell contains hydrophilic heads.",
  "再观察内侧表面：胞质溶胶也是水环境，内侧那层同样有亲水头部。": "Observe the inner surface again: the cytosol is also a water environment, and the inner layer also has hydrophilic heads.",
  "所有膜蛋白都必须穿过整层膜。": "All membrane proteins must cross the entire membrane.",
  "外周蛋白附着在膜表面，不穿过整层膜。请对照两类蛋白的位置。": "Peripheral proteins are attached to the membrane surface and do not penetrate the entire membrane. Please compare the locations of the two types of proteins.",
  "重新作答": "Answer again",
  "本模型是典型动物细胞质膜的局部教学示意，不表示所有细胞膜的组成比例。": "This model is a partial teaching representation of a typical animal cell plasma membrane and does not represent the composition ratio of all cell membranes.",
  "颜色、尺寸、间距、数量和位置经过简化，不是原子结构或真实比例。": "Color, size, spacing, quantity and position are simplified and are not atomic structures or true proportions.",
  "脂质和蛋白被固定以便观察；真实膜具有流动性。本轮不模拟流动、运输或膜形成过程。": "Lipids and proteins are fixed for viewing; real membranes are fluid. This round does not simulate flow, transport or film formation processes.",
  "糖链、蛋白与胆固醇使用抽象形状，未展示完整化学结构。": "Sugar chains, proteins, and cholesterol use abstract shapes and do not show complete chemical structures.",
