  "查看课程地图": "View course map",
  "OpenStax Biology 2e · 10.2 细胞周期": "OpenStax Biology 2e · 10.2 Cell Cycle",
  "复制后的染色体逐条排列在赤道面；每条染色体的两条姐妹染色单体分别与相反两极相连。": "The replicated chromosomes are arranged one by one on the equatorial plane; the two sister chromatids of each chromosome are connected to opposite poles.",
  "四条染色体沿赤道面排成一列，不进行同源配对。": "The four chromosomes are arranged in a row along the equatorial plane without homologous pairing.",
  "姐妹染色单体在着丝粒处分开，成为子染色体并移向两极；每极各获得 A1、A2、B1、B2 各一个拷贝。": "The sister chromatids separate at the centromere and become daughter chromosomes that move to the poles; each pole gets one copy of A1, A2, B1, and B2.",
