  "a·b 未分离": "a·b not separated",
  "a 正移向左极 · b 正移向右极": "a moving to the left pole · b moving to the right pole",
  "先观察分子的运动": "First observe the movement of molecules",
  "亮点代表氧气分子。看看它们如何在两侧移动；实验进入本步后已自动开始。": "The bright spots represent oxygen molecules. See how they move on both sides; the experiment starts automatically when you enter this step.",
  "你随时掌握实验节奏": "You can control the pace of experiments at any time",
  "这里可以暂停、继续、单步和重播。想看清一次变化时，先暂停再单步。": "Here you can pause, resume, step and replay. When you want to see a change clearly, pause first and then step.",
  "比较两个方向的计数": "Compare counts in two directions",
  "观察左→右与右→左的累计事件，看看总体变化与刚才的预测是否一致。": "Observe the cumulative events of left → right and right → left to see whether the overall change is consistent with the prediction just now.",
  "a → 左极 · b → 右极": "a → left pole · b → right pole",
  "a → 左核 · b → 右核": "a → left nucleus · b → right nucleus",
