  "阶段": "stage",
  "第": "Step ",
  "阶段 ·": "Stage ·",
  "播放中": "Playing",
  "此前复制的 DNA 通过姐妹染色单体分离被分配到两侧；每个子细胞都保留 4 条染色体及完整的染色体组成。分裂分配了复制产物，并非把原有遗传信息减半。": "Previously replicated DNA is divided between the two sides through sister chromatid separation; each daughter cell retains 4 chromosomes and its complete chromosome composition. Division distributes the products of replication, rather than halving the original genetic information.",
  "回答正确。": "The answer is correct.",
  "回答不正确，正确是 B。": "The answer is incorrect, the correct answer is B.",
  "展开最近 5 个模拟秒的统计": "Expand statistics for the last 5 simulated seconds",
  "收起窗口统计": "Close window statistics",
  "五步形成完整学习路径": "Five steps to form a complete learning path",
  "之后继续比较运输通路、观察动态平衡并检查理解；顶部步骤可以随时返回。": "Then continue comparing transport pathways, observing dynamic equilibrium, and checking understanding; you can return to the top steps at any time.",
  "实验已经开始": "The experiment has begun",
  "先观察分子运动，再向下浏览模型控制与累计计数。暂停、单步和重播按钮旁都有对应说明。": "Start by observing molecular motion, then scroll down to model controls and cumulative counts. There are instructions next to the pause, step, and replay buttons.",
  "我知道了": "I see",
  "现在：选择一个预测并提交。答案会保留到实验结果出现后再对照。": "Now: Select a prediction and submit. The answers will be kept until the results of the experiment are available for comparison.",
  "实验已自动开始：先观察粒子，再用两个方向的累计计数检验预测。": "The experiment has started automatically: particles are observed, and predictions are tested using cumulative counts in both directions.",
  "现在：选择葡萄糖，比较有、无载体。每次切换都会重置并暂停，需要再次点击开始。": "Now: choose glucose, with or without a carrier. Each switch will reset and pause, requiring you to click Start again.",
  "现在：点击“从等浓度开始”建立情境，再点击模型下方的“开始”观察。": "Now: Click \"Start from Equal Concentration\" to establish the situation, and then click \"Start\" under the model to observe.",
  "现在：回看最初的预测与氧气实验计数，再回答一道有关双向运动的问题。": "Now: Look back at the original predictions and oxygen experimental counts, and answer a question about bidirectional motion.",
  "预测已锁定：进入第 2 步，让实验自动运行并检验想法。": "Prediction locked: Go to step 2 to automate the experiment and test your idea.",
  "收起操作提示": "Close operation tips",
