  "还没有足够的氧气实验数据": "There is not enough oxygen experimental data yet",
  "分子在两方向持续运动。起初左侧浓度更高，左到右的跨膜事件通常更多；回看你的预测，想想它解释了哪一部分现象。": "Molecules are constantly moving in both directions. Initially the concentration is higher on the left side, and there are usually more transmembrane events from left to right; look back at your prediction and think about what part of the phenomenon it explains.",
  "返回第 2 步，观察一段时间的氧气跨膜计数，再来对比最初的预测。": "Go back to step 2 and observe the oxygen transmembrane counts over time to compare with the original prediction.",
  "目前两个方向累计相同": "Currently, the cumulative total in both directions is the same.",
  "未记录": "Not recorded",
  "这组实验数据支持你的预测。": "This set of experimental data supports your prediction.",
  "这组实验数据与原预测不同；这正是实验帮助我们修正想法的地方。": "This set of experimental data differs from the original prediction; this is where experiments help us revise our ideas.",
  "科学解释：分子在两个方向都持续随机运动。左侧初始浓度更高，因此统计上左→右的跨膜机会更多，形成从高浓度到低浓度的净移动；单个分子仍可能向任一方向运动。": "Molecules move randomly in both directions. The initial concentration is higher on the left, so left-to-right crossings are statistically more likely, producing net movement down the concentration gradient. Individual molecules can still move either way.",
  "重看聚光教程": "Rewatch the spotlight tutorial",
